  "description": "SDK end-to-end vectors for the policies in e2e/policies.json. request is a Speedle+ REST JsonContext without serviceName; the runner adds serviceName from SPEEDLE_E2E_SERVICE. expect is the is-allowed body that Speedle+ returned (speedlePlus is its commit), which Speedle Cloud must return unchanged.",
